# Generated renders are never source files.
out
renders

# whisper.cpp build and models, downloaded on demand.
.whisper

# Narration and recording stems.
#
# The content licence excludes narration recordings, and these run to about
# 300 MB across the raw takes, the noise-reduced passes and the masters. The
# caption JSON beside them IS committed: every animation in every scene is
# timed off those files, so the project does not build without them.
#
# See "Narration audio" in README.md for how to render without the stems.
curriculum/**/audio/*.aac
curriculum/**/audio/*.aiff
curriculum/**/audio/*.flac
curriculum/**/audio/*.m4a
curriculum/**/audio/*.mp3
curriculum/**/audio/*.ogg
curriculum/**/audio/*.opus
curriculum/**/audio/*.wav
curriculum/**/audio/clean/
curriculum/**/audio/master/
# Links to the masters locally: one per episode, since two tracks both have a
# scene-01 and a single flat folder cannot hold both. Not shipped: the targets
# are ignored, so a clone would get dangling links.
public/narration

# Local tooling state and personal agent workflow, not project configuration.
.serena/
.agents/

# Attention measurement environment. Rebuilt by scripts/measure-attention.sh.
.attention-venv

# Third-party 3D assets, downloaded on demand. See third_party/README.md.
third_party/*/

# The deplaning reel's Blender renders, made by scripts/blender/deplane/render.sh.
public/vr36/

# The lift-door reel's Blender renders, made by scripts/blender/elevator/render.sh.
public/vr38/
public/vr39/
public/vr40/
public/vr42/

# Python bytecode from the Blender scripts importing each other.
__pycache__/
